_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwii__a79tmWAxXGANAFHfmJBm0Q3YcHCG8oAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwii__a79tmWAxXGANAFHfmJBm0Q3IcHCG4oCw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["招牌拉麵： 這次點了配料最豪華的版本，裡面有大片的炙燒叉燒肉、軟嫩的雞肉還有鮮蝦，海陸雙享超滿足。湯頭濃郁但不膩口，搭配半熟溏心蛋和清脆的玉米筍，層次感很豐富。\n• 明太子叉燒飯： 誠心推薦必點！明太子醬給得很大方，拌開後鹹甜適中，每一口都能吃到切丁叉燒，非常有飽足感。\n• 唐揚炸雞： 外皮炸得金黃酥脆，肉質還保有水分，沾一點旁邊附的七味粉和美乃滋，味道更加分。\n店內裝潢明亮簡約，給人很舒服的用餐環境。餐具乾淨，上菜速度也算快。以連鎖拉麵店來說，這樣的品質與份量，CP 值相當高，是會想再次回訪的店家！",null,[0,135]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPTlUxNlNtbFVWM2d4VVZWM01WVlZUVEpWVmpsdFRtdEdXVlJYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPTlUxNlNtbFVWM2d4VVZWM01WVlZUVEpWVmpsdFRtdEdXVlJYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPTlUxNlNtbFVWM2d4VVZWM01WVlZUVEpWVmpsdFRtdEdXVlJYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPTlUxNlNtbFVWM2d4VVZWM01WVlZUVEpWVmpsdFRtdEdXVlJYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPTlUxNlNtbFVWM2d4VVZWM01WVlZUVEpWVmpsdFRtdEdXVlJYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPTlUxNlNtbFVWM2d4VVZWM01WVlZUVEpWVmpsdFRtdEdXVlJYWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1644,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pONU16SmlUV3gxUVV3MVVVTTJVVjltTmtGWVRXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x6bd47f28faf27026!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjN5MzJiTWx1QUw1UUM2UV9mNkFYTWc%7C%7C?hl\u003dz