麵 則濃醇順口，讓人回味無窮！尤其是 炙燒培根牛香蒜蛤蜊拉麵🦪，蛤蜊的鮮甜和培根的香氣搭配得恰到好處，真的很值得一試！\n\n🍴 不僅拉麵美味，套餐裡的小菜也讓人驚喜！✨ 胡麻豆腐的滑嫩細膩、金翠泡菜的酸甜爽口，每一樣都很有特色。更讓人感動的是，服務人員非常親切，讓我們整個用餐過程都覺得賓至如歸，心情非常愉快！🎉\n\n特別是離開時，還看到一位服務人員主動詢問一位坐著的小妹妹，需不需要加軟墊，因為妹妹不夠高，脖子卡在桌子上。這樣細心的觀察和貼心的舉動，真的讓人覺得暖心滿滿，也對這家餐廳留下了深刻的好印象。❤️",null,[0,158]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjJkRXhFVWxGUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjJkRXhFVWxGUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjJkRXhFVWxGUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjJkRXhFVWxGUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjJkRXhFVWxGUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjJkRXhFVWxGUkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,7730,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2dExEUlFREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x6bd47f28faf27026!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICvtLDRQQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2dExEUlFREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2dExEUlFREi0KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ3Z0TERSd1FFEhJDZ3NJcktQV3VnWVFnSzZ1TVEaLAoWQ0lITTBvZ0tFSUNBZ0lDdnRMRFJJURISQ2dzSXJLUFd1Z1lRZ0s2dU1RIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARJnDy-ih_1GsqCzBiS082Umo0ZUc3\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwii__a79tmWAxXGANAFHfmJBm0QoykIuwEoCA"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiBgv-79tmWAxVv_xoGHdt-AXsQ0pMFCFUoBQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwii__a79tmWAxXGANAFHfmJBm0Q0pMFCK4BKAU"],[["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfeUszOHR3RRAB",["0x0:0x